<bridgehead renderas="sect2">Terms and definitions</bridgehead>
<variablelist>
<varlistentry><term><emphasis role="strong">Morph</emphasis></term>
<listitem>
<para>A dependency-free markup converter.</para>
</listitem>
<listitem>
<para>A shared document model with multiple emitters.</para>
</listitem>
</varlistentry>
<varlistentry><term>Lossless</term>
<listitem>
<para>Equivalent structure survives a round trip when both formats can express it.</para>
</listitem>
</varlistentry>
</variablelist>
